{
  "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>롯데월드타워 개념 설계 — grok-4.7</title>\n<style>\n:root{--ink:#1a2430;--paper:#f4efe6;--line:#2c3a4a;--accent:#0e6b62;--gold:#b08a3e;--mute:#5c6670;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;height:100%;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",serif;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45}\nbody{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:100vh}\nheader{padding:14px 18px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfc6b6}\nh1{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 4px;font-weight:600}\n.sub{font-size:19px;color:var(--mute);margin:0}\n.badge{display:inline-block;font-size:19px;border:1px solid var(--gold);padding:2px 8px;margin-left:8px;color:var(--gold)}\nmain{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.15fr;gap:12px;padding:12px;flex:1}\n@media(max-width:900px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\nsection{background:#fffdf8;border:1px solid #d8d0c2;padding:10px}\nh2{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 8px}\n.tabs,.stages{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px}\nbutton{font-size:19px;padding:8px 12px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #b7aea0;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit}\nbutton[aria-pressed=\"true\"],button.active{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}\nbutton:focus{outline:3px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:2px}\n#draw{width:100%;height:420px;background:#fbf8f2;display:block;touch-action:manipulation}\n#view3d{width:100%;height:480px;display:block;background:#e8eef2;touch-action:none}\n.note{font-size:19px;color:var(--mute);margin:8px 0 0}\n.legend{font-size:19px}\nfooter{padding:10px 18px 16px;font-size:19px;color:var(--mute)}\na{color:var(--accent)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n<h1>롯데월드타워 개념 재구성 <span class=\"badge\">grok-4.7</span></h1>\n<p class=\"sub\">공개 설명에 근거한 교육용 개념 모델입니다. 공식 시공 도면·검증 구조가 아닙니다. 공개되지 않은 치수·단면·부재는 추정입니다.</p>\n</header>\n<main>\n<section>\n<h2>도면</h2>\n<div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n<button type=\"button\" data-view=\"site\" aria-pressed=\"true\">배치도</button>\n<button type=\"button\" data-view=\"plan\" aria-pressed=\"false\">기준층 평면도</button>\n<button type=\"button\" data-view=\"elev\" aria-pressed=\"false\">입면도</button>\n<button type=\"button\" data-view=\"sec\" aria-pressed=\"false\">단면도</button>\n</div>\n<canvas id=\"draw\" width=\"900\" height=\"560\" aria-label=\"개념 도면\"></canvas>\n<p class=\"note\" id=\"drawnote\"></p>\n</section>\n<section>\n<h2>단계별 3D · 완성 모델</h2>\n<div class=\"stages\">\n<button type=\"button\" data-stage=\"0\" class=\"active\">1 매스</button>\n<button type=\"button\" data-stage=\"1\">2 테이퍼</button>\n<button type=\"button\" data-stage=\"2\">3 도자 윤곽</button>\n<button type=\"button\" data-stage=\"3\">4 완성</button>\n</div>\n<canvas id=\"view3d\" aria-label=\"3D 모델\"></canvas>\n<div class=\"stages\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">\n<button type=\"button\" id=\"reset\">시점 초기화</button>\n<button type=\"button\" id=\"zin\">확대</button>\n<button type=\"button\" id=\"zout\">축소</button>\n</div>\n<p class=\"legend\" id=\"stagecopy\"></p>\n<p class=\"note\">드래그 회전, 휠·핀치 확대. 키보드: 화살표 궤도, +/− 줌, R 초기화. 전체 높이 555m(크라운 포함). 단위 m. 기준: 지상 123층, 높이 555m. KPF는 한국 도자기 선을 형태·외관에 참고했다고 설명합니다.</p>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer>\n출처(텍스트만, 실행 중 요청하지 않음): <a href=\"https://www.kpf.com/project/lotte-world-tower\">KPF 원설계</a> · <a href=\"https://www.lera.com/lotte-world-tower\">LERA 구조</a>. 모델 식별: grok-4.7 (us.xai.grok-4.7).\n</footer>\n<script src=\"../runtime/three-runtime.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\nvar H=555;\nvar reduce=window.matchMedia&&window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\nvar view='site', stage=3;\nvar notes={\nsite:'배치도(개념). 잠실 초고층 부지에서 타워 점유와 저층 포디움을 구분한 추정 배치입니다. 축척 없음. 실제 대지면적·이격은 공개 도면이 아니므로 표시하지 않습니다.',\nplan:'기준층 평면도(개념, 중층대 추정). 위로 갈수록 외곽이 줄어드는 원형에 가까운 코어+임대 링. 치수는 추정: 중층 외경 약 60m(공개 치수 아님). 단위 m.',\nelev:'입면도. 전체 높이 555m(크라운 포함), 지상 123층. 도자기처럼 위로 좁아지는 윤곽. 층고·셋백 위치는 개념 추정이며 시공 입면이 아닙니다.',\nsec:'단면도(개념). 중심 코어와 테이퍼 외피, 크라운까지 포함한 총고 555m. 부재 크기·슬래브 두께는 추정이며 구조 검증값이 아닙니다.'\n};\nvar stageTxt=[\n'1단계: 123층·555m를 담는 수직 원통 매스. 면적 변화 없음.',\n'2단계: 상층으로 기준층이 줄어드는 단순 테이퍼.',\n'3단계: KPF가 언급한 한국 도자기 곡선을 윤곽에 반영한 개념 실루엣. 크라운은 555m 안에 포함.',\n'4단계: 완성 개념 모델. 회전·확대·초기화로 전체 높이를 확인합니다. 도면의 입면·단면과 같은 555m입니다.'\n];\nfunction setNote(){document.getElementById('drawnote').textContent=notes[view];document.getElementById('stagecopy').textContent=stageTxt[stage];}\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){view=b.getAttribute('data-view');document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach(function(x){x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',x===b?'true':'false');});draw();});});\nfunction radiusAt(t){\nvar ceramic=1-0.62*Math.pow(t,1.15);\nvar belly=0.08*Math.sin(Math.PI*Math.min(1,t*1.05));\nreturn Math.max(0.16, ceramic+belly*(1-t));\n}\nfunction draw(){\nvar c=document.getElementById('draw'), ctx=c.getContext('2d');\nvar w=c.width,h=c.height;ctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);\nctx.fillStyle='#fbf8f2';ctx.fillRect(0,0,w,h);\nctx.strokeStyle='#2c3a4a';ctx.fillStyle='#1a2430';ctx.lineWidth=1.5;ctx.font='19px Georgia, serif';\nif(view==='site'){\nctx.strokeRect(80,70,740,400);ctx.fillText('개념 부지 경계 (축척 없음)',90,100);\nctx.fillStyle='#d7ece8';ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(450,280,70,70,0,0,6.28);ctx.fill();ctx.stroke();\nctx.fillStyle='#1a2430';ctx.fillText('타워 점유(원형 개념)',470,275);\nctx.strokeRect(250,360,400,70);ctx.fillText('저층 포디움(추정 범위)',360,400);\nctx.fillText('북',450,60);\n}else if(view==='plan'){\nvar cx=450,cy=280,R=160;\nctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(cx,cy,R,0,6.28);ctx.stroke();\nctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(cx,cy,48,0,6.28);ctx.stroke();\nctx.fillText('코어(추정)',cx-40,cy+6);\nfor(var i=0;i<8;i++){var a=i*Math.PI/4;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(cx+52*Math.cos(a),cy+52*Math.sin(a));ctx.lineTo(cx+(R-8)*Math.cos(a),cy+(R-8)*Math.sin(a));ctx.stroke();}\nctx.fillText('중층 기준층 외경 약 60m — 추정, 공개 치수 아님',90,70);\nctx.fillText('상층일수록 이 원이 작아짐 (입면과 대응)',90,500);\n}else if(view==='elev'||view==='sec'){\nvar baseY=500,topY=40,x0=450,half=150;\nctx.beginPath();\nvar steps=40;\nfor(var s=0;s<=steps;s++){\nvar t=s/steps;var y=baseY-(baseY-topY)*t;var rr=half*radiusAt(t);\nif(s===0)ctx.moveTo(x0-rr,y);else ctx.lineTo(x0-rr,y);\n}\nfor(var s2=steps;s2>=0;s2--){var t2=s2/steps;var y2=baseY-(baseY-topY)*t2;var rr2=half*radiusAt(t2);ctx.lineTo(x0+rr2,y2);}\nctx.closePath();ctx.stroke();\nif(view==='sec'){ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x0-18,baseY);ctx.lineTo(x0-10,topY+30);ctx.lineTo(x0+10,topY+30);ctx.lineTo(x0+18,baseY);ctx.stroke();ctx.fillText('코어(개념)',x0+24,300);}\nctx.fillText('555 m 전체 (크라운 포함)',x0+170,topY+20);\nctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x0+160,topY);ctx.lineTo(x0+160,baseY);ctx.stroke();\nctx.fillText('0',x0+168,baseY);ctx.fillText('GL',80,baseY);\nctx.fillText(view==='elev'?'입면: 도자형 테이퍼':'단면: 동일 총고 555m',80,70);\nctx.fillText('123층 · 치수 근거: 공개된 전체 높이만 확정, 윤곽은 추정',80,520);\n}\n}\nfunction profilePoints(){\nvar pts=[];\nvar n=stage===0?2:28;\nfor(var i=0;i<=n;i++){\nvar t=i/n;\nvar r;\nif(stage===0)r=1;\nelse if(stage===1)r=1-0.55*t;\nelse r=radiusAt(t);\nvar y=(t-0.5)*H;\npts.push(new THREE.Vector2(Math.max(4,r*42), y));\n}\nreturn pts;\n}\nvar renderer,scene,camera,controls,mesh,root;\nfunction buildMesh(){\nif(mesh){root.remove(mesh);mesh.geometry.dispose();mesh.material.dispose();}\nvar geo=new THREE.LatheGeometry(profilePoints(),48);\nvar mat=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:stage<3?0xc5d5d2:0xe7f0ea,metalness:0.15,roughness:0.45,side:THREE.DoubleSide});\nmesh=new THREE.Mesh(geo,mat);\nroot.add(mesh);\nvar edges=new THREE.LineSegments(new THREE.EdgesGeometry(geo,28),new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:0x1a3a36}));\nmesh.add(edges);\n}\nfunction fit(){\nvar dist=H*1.35;\ncamera.position.set(dist*0.55, H*0.08, dist*0.85);\ncontrols.target.set(0,0,0);\ncamera.near=1;camera.far=8000;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\ncontrols.update();\n}\nfunction init3d(){\nvar canvas=document.getElementById('view3d');\nrenderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({canvas:canvas,antialias:true});\nrenderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(2,window.devicePixelRatio||1));\nscene=new THREE.Scene();scene.background=new THREE.Color(0xe8eef2);\ncamera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(38,1,1,8000);\nroot=new THREE.Group();scene.add(root);\nscene.add(new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff,0.65));\nvar d=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,0.9);d.position.set(200,400,180);scene.add(d);\nvar grid=new THREE.GridHelper(400,20,0x9aa,0xccd);grid.position.y=-H/2;scene.add(grid);\ncontrols=new THREE.OrbitControls(camera,canvas);\ncontrols.enableDamping=!reduce;controls.dampingFactor=0.08;\ncontrols.target.set(0,0,0);\nbuildMesh();fit();\nfunction resize(){\nvar r=canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\nvar w=Math.max(320,r.width),h=Math.max(360,r.height);\nrenderer.setSize(w,h,false);camera.aspect=w/h;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n}\nresize();window.addEventListener('resize',resize);\nfunction loop(){requestAnimationFrame(loop);if(!reduce)controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);}\nloop();\n}\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-stage]').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){stage=+b.getAttribute('data-stage');document.querySelectorAll('[data-stage]').forEach(function(x){x.classList.toggle('active',x===b);});buildMesh();setNote();});});\nfunction nudge(dx,dy,dz){\ncamera.position.x+=dx;camera.position.y+=dy;camera.position.z+=dz;\ncontrols.update();\n}\ndocument.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click',fit);\ndocument.getElementById('zin').addEventListener('click',function(){camera.position.multiplyScalar(0.85);controls.update();});\ndocument.getElementById('zout').addEventListener('click',function(){camera.position.multiplyScalar(1.15);controls.update();});\nwindow.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){\nvar k=e.key;var step=18;\nif(k==='ArrowLeft'){nudge(-step,0,0);e.preventDefault();}\nelse if(k==='ArrowRight'){nudge(step,0,0);e.preventDefault();}\nelse if(k==='ArrowUp'){nudge(0,step,0);e.preventDefault();}\nelse if(k==='ArrowDown'){nudge(0,-step,0);e.preventDefault();}\nelse if(k==='+'||k==='='){camera.position.multiplyScalar(0.9);controls.update();}\nelse if(k==='-'||k==='_'){camera.position.multiplyScalar(1.1);controls.update();}\nelse if(k==='r'||k==='R'){fit();}\n});\nsetNote();draw();init3d();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
